iedma Pérez","email":"72617878+Lucasgvdii@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2025-12-02T16:40:12Z"},"message":"Add Zigchain docs and update chain table schemas\n\nAdded documentation and config entries for Zigchain. Updated multiple chain table schemas to include new columns such as 'header' (JSON) and 'block_timestamp' (TIMESTAMP). Added new parsed tables and columns to dydx_mainnet and zigchain tables, and improved event/action indexing for several chains. Updated available chains documentation to include Zigchain.","tree":{"sha":"b3dcbeb981e0ac2940885a87aabfccba032820e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numiadata/numia-docs/git/trees/b3dcbeb981e0ac2940885a87aabfccba032820e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numiadata/numia-docs/git/commits/802c943a2ac571bf203a3d1c41af539c842c0778","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numiadata/numia-docs/commits/802c943a2ac571bf203a3d1c41af539c842c0778","html_url":"https://github.com/numiadata/numia-docs/commit/802c943a2ac571bf203a3d1c41af539c842c0778","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/numiadata/numia-docs/commits/802c943a2ac571bf203a3d1c41af539c842c0778/comments","author":{"login":"Lucasgvdii","id":72617878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjE3ODc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72617878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii","html_url":"https://github.com/Lucasgvdii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucasgvdii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lucas